SUMMARY:Pennsylvania Renaissance Faire
DESCRIPTION:Step through the castle gates and into the 35-acre village of Mount Hope\, where the year is 1567 and Queen Elizabeth herself has come to visit the Shire! The Pennsylvania Renaissance Faire returns for its 2026 season with jousting knights\, over 90 stage shows daily\, 22 Royal Kitchens\, and more than 100 artisan merchants offering hand-crafted wares. A cast of hundreds of colorfully costumed characters fills the lanes with music\, dancing\, swordplay\, and merriment. Cheer the Ultimate Joust at Bosworth Field\, witness Human Chess\, laugh through the Boarshead Brawl stunt comedy\, and join the Finale Pub Sing. Each weekend brings a new theme\, from Fairies & Fantasy and Viking Weekend to Oktoberfest and Halloween Days & Spooky Knights. Special ticketed experiences include a 21+ Pub Crawl\, glassblowing sessions\, escape rooms\, and Meet the Falconer. Well-behaved dogs are welcome through our Dog Friendly Faire program. Rain or shine; date-specific tickets available online only. Huzzah! \n            \n        \n                \n            \n                \n                \n    Buy Tickets
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/pennsylvania-renaissance-faire/
LOCATION:Pennsylvania Renaissance Faire at Mount Hope Estate & Winery\, 2775 Lebanon Rd.\, Manheim\, PA\, 17545\, United States
CATEGORIES:Festivals & Annual Events
ORGANIZER;CN="Pennsylvania Renaissance Faire":MAILTO:robb@lancelotlive.com
END:VEVENT
