SUMMARY:Autumn Harvest Cocktail Class
DESCRIPTION:Join Clear Ice & Bitters at Ken’s Gardens in Smoketown for an autumn harvest cocktail class! Learn to make seasonal drinks that incorporate the plants and harvests of late summer/autumn (with or without spirits)\, just in time to share with your friends and family at the weekend barbecues! \n\n\n\nDue to PA Liquor Control Board regulations\, alcohol is not included. Please bring a bottle of your favorite spirit with you. \n\n\n\nAdvance tickets are $75 via EventBrite\, or pay at the door via Venmo. For group pricing\, please contact JAdams@ClearIceAndBitters.com \n\n\n\n\n    get tickets
