SUMMARY:SparkDate: Real People\, Real Drinks\, Real Court
DESCRIPTION:Skip the endless app scrolling and awkward bar encounters for an evening of intentional\, real-life connections. This event brings together a room full of people who all showed up on purpose for genuine\, low-stress interactions. \n\n\n\nWhat to Expect: Check in with the host\, grab your name tag—no downloads or profile forms required—and dive into a structured\, three-part night. First\, kick off the evening seated at small tables with easy icebreaker games; men rotate each round so every group is entirely new. Next\, transition into open mingling to wander\, chat\, and connect naturally with people you’ve already broken the ice with. Finish with fast-paced one-on-ones to meet anyone you missed. Before you leave\, take sixty seconds to privately note who you’d like to see again; mutual matches are delivered that very night. \n\n\n\n 21+ with valid photo IDTickets and full details: https://sparkdate.date/l/mc-figlancaster \n\n\n\nDoors Open: 6:30 PM \n\n\n\n\n\n\n    Buy Tickets
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/sparkdate-real-people-real-drinks-real-court/
LOCATION:Marion Court Room\, 7 East Marion STreet\, Lancaster\, Pennsylvania\, 17602\, United States
CATEGORIES:Community
ORGANIZER;CN="SparkDate":MAILTO:taylor.ancapital@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
