SUMMARY:Bike & Hike
DESCRIPTION:Hosted by COBYS Family Services\, th 30th annual Bike & Hike is COBYS signature fundraiser and community event consisting of a three-mile walk through Lititz\, a 10- or 25-mile bicycle ride\, and returning for a second year\, the Tasty Tour. The Tasty Tour is a 1.5 mile walk to Lititz with four stops at local eateries to sample tasty treats. All events end back at the church for the Incredible Ice Cream Celebration.  \n\n\n\nRegistration is open now and runs through the day of the event for the three-mile walk and bicycle rides. The Tasty Tour is pre-registration only until August 26\, so participants can enjoy treats from our participating restaurants. Walk and ride registration is $30 and Tasty Tour is $60 with early bird discounts available. Pre-registration is encouraged\, and participants can even create their own online fundraising page.  \n\n\n\nDetails and registration for the event: www.cobys.org/bike-and-hike. Dollars raised provide critical operating funds for COBYS\, ensuring that care continues each day throughout the year. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n    Learn More
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/bike-hike/
LOCATION:Lititz Church of the Brethren\, 300 West Orange Street\, Lititz\, Pennsylvania\, 17543\, United States
CATEGORIES:Community
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/07/30th-logo.avif
ORGANIZER;CN="COBYS Family Services":MAILTO:anne@cobys.org
END:VEVENT
