SUMMARY:Let’s Get Mossy! Fall Kokedama Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Let’s Get Mossy! Create your own fall-inspired Kokedama and learn the art\, history\, and care behind these living moss ball sculptures. Unwind at the end of your day and join Gallery Grow for an intimate happy hour workshop with expert instruction. As always\, BYOB. Slow down\, connect with nature\, and create your own living work of art.  \n\n\n\nKokedama\, meaning “moss ball\,” is a Japanese botanical art form that transforms a simple plant into a sculptural piece wrapped in living moss. During this hands-on workshop\, you’ll learn the history behind Kokedama\, create your own moss-covered plant design\, and discover how to care for your new living companion. No experience necessary — just bring your creativity and a love for plants! \n\n\n\n\n\n\n    Buy Tickets
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/lets-get-mossy-fall-kokedama-workshop/
LOCATION:Gallery Grow\, 320 North Queen Street\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17603\, United States
CATEGORIES:Education & Classes
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/08/GG-Kokedama-HH-2200-x-1100-px.avif
END:VEVENT
