SUMMARY:Lewiston-
DESCRIPTION:LEWISTON is the first piece in a two part series set in the small twin towns of Lewiston\, Idaho and Clarkston\, Washington named for the infamous explorers who blazed the American trail to the west coast. Audiences will be immersed in a journey of discovery and legacy\, and can return in January 2027 for part 2.  \n\n\n\n “Creative Works of Lancaster is the perfect organization to set a site-specific production of this poignant piece of theater\, and we hope that our audiences will enjoy the play’s metaphorical (and literal) fireworks.” – Jimmy Damore\, director of LEWISTON. \n\n\n\n\n    Buy Tickets
