SUMMARY:L’Italia Festival
DESCRIPTION:Experience the sights\, sounds\, and flavors of Italy at L’Italia Festival\, a free\, family-friendly event taking place in the heart of Lititz\, PA. This event features more than 25 authentic Italian food vendors\, cooking demonstrations\, live music\, dance performances\, Italian cars\, children’s activities\, and over 50 artisan vendors. Now celebrating its fifth year\, L’Italia Festival transforms E. Main Street into a vibrant celebration of Italian culture\, traditions\, and community. \n\n\n\n\n    Learn More
